  "prefLabel": "Env-A 801.03 Submission to and Other Contact with DES",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 801.03 Submission to and Other Contact with DES. Any application, request, report, notification, or other information required or allowed by this chapter to be provided to the department and any notification required or allowed by this chapter to be provided to the department by telephone, fax, or email shall be submitted or directed as specified in Appendix B.\n\nSource. #12762, eff 5-1-19",
